 <description>&lt;div class=&quot;flickrfloat&quot;&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://maps.google.com/maps?f=q&amp;amp;source=embed&amp;amp;hl=en&amp;amp;geocode=&amp;amp;q=http:%2F%2Fwww.hobobiker.com%2Ffiles%2Fgps%2FEntireTrip.kmz%3F1234ab&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;ll=13.445704,-101.944286&amp;amp;spn=102.957825,149.414063&amp;amp;z=2&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/files/wholetrip50.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a map of the whole trip.  To explore in more detail (via Google Maps), click on the map or below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://maps.google.com/maps?f=q&amp;amp;source=embed&amp;amp;hl=en&amp;amp;geocode=&amp;amp;q=http:%2F%2Fwww.hobobiker.com%2Ffiles%2Fgps%2FEntireTrip.kmz%3F1234ab&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;ll=13.445704,-101.944286&amp;amp;spn=102.957825,149.414063&amp;amp;z=2&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Click for a bigger interactive map to explore&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some details of the trip:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We went almost 14,000 miles (22,000 kilometers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starting date: June 9, 2006&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Return date: January 14, 2009&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Biggest mileage day: 89 miles (143 kilometers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Number of lifelong memories: Uncountable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazingly wonderful, gracious people: Uncountable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Number of times we were threatened by bad people: 0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Number of petty thefts of our stuff: 3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sets of bike tires we went through: 4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
